  "description": "Min-ah, in despair over the death of her father, a reporter, swaps souls with Yu-bin, the daughter of presidential candidate Jong-seong, who thought she would have killed her father. She digs behind Jong-sung and vows to avenge her father, but his power is too strong. She is forced to face her grim truth about her father's death... \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
